WEBVTT

00:12.530 --> 00:20.580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

00:20.580 --> 00:28.340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

00:44.920 --> 00:46.940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

00:46.940 --> 00:50.810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

00:52.820 --> 00:54.930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

00:54.930 --> 00:58.720
♪Be brave enough to split
the primal chaos wide open♪

01:36.380 --> 01:37.620
[Pull Strings]

01:37.620 --> 01:39.380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

01:39.460 --> 01:42.300
[Episode 22]

01:44.640 --> 01:46.330
At that time, I was barely conscious.

01:47.510 --> 01:48.930
I could only entrust
this great undertaking

01:49.510 --> 01:50.740
to you and Jiu Wu.

01:52.230 --> 01:52.930
You two

01:54.510 --> 01:57.460
truly united the Three Sects.

01:59.680 --> 02:01.660
I am truly gratified.

02:03.920 --> 02:04.690
Senior.

02:10.000 --> 02:10.780
Senior,

02:11.360 --> 02:12.450
is it because

02:12.870 --> 02:14.820
I didn't persuade Aunt Jiu Jiu to come

02:15.190 --> 02:15.980
that Uncle Jiu Wu...

02:17.960 --> 02:18.780
I'm sorry.

02:19.190 --> 02:20.290
It's not your fault.

02:22.560 --> 02:24.380
Mentor was worried about us,

02:25.590 --> 02:27.690
so he had Uncle Jiu Wu look after us.

02:34.080 --> 02:36.540
You can never truly know
someone's heart.

02:42.960 --> 02:43.980
Uncle Jiu Wu...

02:46.840 --> 02:47.610
I'll play weiqi with you

02:49.400 --> 02:51.340
in the next life.

03:08.310 --> 03:11.060
You promised me you'd come back.

03:12.680 --> 03:13.610
Liar.

03:24.800 --> 03:26.660
I was the one supposed to go.

03:26.680 --> 03:28.570
The one who should have died was me.

03:29.560 --> 03:31.100
Why you?

03:33.470 --> 03:34.730
Get up.

03:35.750 --> 03:37.540
Get up!

03:38.630 --> 03:40.010
I am deeply ashamed.

03:40.280 --> 03:41.540
The pearl of our sect

03:42.120 --> 03:43.980
can actually be used like this.

03:44.240 --> 03:45.010
Changgeng,

03:45.680 --> 03:47.780
what spell did you just use?

03:48.120 --> 03:51.220
That's one of my Montage Art tricks.

03:51.310 --> 03:52.170
It's called

03:52.960 --> 03:54.290
the CAG special effect.

03:54.560 --> 03:56.170
It can add new content at will

03:56.190 --> 03:57.940
in this pearl image,

03:58.400 --> 03:59.610
turning it into an illusion.

03:59.960 --> 04:00.540
Montage...

04:01.030 --> 04:02.060
Montage...

04:02.080 --> 04:03.290
CAG?

04:03.870 --> 04:04.540
An illusion?

04:09.960 --> 04:11.260
The world's magic

04:12.150 --> 04:13.940
is truly ever-changing.

04:14.080 --> 04:15.450
I am again enlightened.

04:15.960 --> 04:16.700
Changgeng,

04:16.720 --> 04:18.100
your mastery is so profound.

04:18.120 --> 04:19.290
Why don't you do it yourself?

04:19.310 --> 04:21.930
Why use my hands for this illusion?

04:22.310 --> 04:25.980
I'm a carefree wandering immortal,

04:26.120 --> 04:27.730
dragged into this mess for no reason,

04:27.750 --> 04:29.490
already entangled in too much karma.

04:29.510 --> 04:31.610
The credit for resolving the crisis
of the Three Sects

04:31.720 --> 04:33.370
shall go to you.

04:33.600 --> 04:35.050
Indifferent to fame and fortune,

04:35.750 --> 04:36.980
and of remarkable attainment.

04:37.120 --> 04:38.730
I've learned much today.

04:38.800 --> 04:40.930
Then I must trouble you as well.

04:41.750 --> 04:42.850
As you've seen for yourself,

04:42.920 --> 04:45.050
this has nothing to do with our sect.

04:45.070 --> 04:47.290
It's that Westdawn
causing all the trouble.

04:48.950 --> 04:52.050
Please pass word to your sect's sage.

04:52.120 --> 04:53.730
Of course, of course.

04:53.750 --> 04:54.490
Many thanks.

04:58.240 --> 04:59.020
Hermit,

04:59.480 --> 05:01.050
what of the item I entrusted to you?

05:04.560 --> 05:05.780
I'm ashamed.

05:07.830 --> 05:10.780
I couldn't tell what treasure it was,

05:10.870 --> 05:12.930
but it drew hordes
of demons from all around.

05:12.950 --> 05:14.930
They swarmed me.

05:15.560 --> 05:17.370
I couldn't hold them off alone.

05:17.600 --> 05:18.900
What do you mean?

05:19.560 --> 05:20.580
You didn't lose it, did you?

05:20.600 --> 05:22.100
Why didn't you lose yourself too?

05:22.600 --> 05:23.370
I've had it.

05:25.310 --> 05:27.100
I've wronged you, Changgeng.

05:27.270 --> 05:28.170
I willingly accept punishment.

05:28.190 --> 05:29.580
Forget about punishment.

05:29.600 --> 05:30.980
What good is punishing you now?

05:31.000 --> 05:32.100
You lost his stuff.

05:32.120 --> 05:33.410
Pay 50,000 spirit stones.

05:33.430 --> 05:34.220
How much?

05:34.310 --> 05:35.220
Or give me that pearl instead.

05:36.000 --> 05:37.290
Hermit, do not blame yourself.

05:37.560 --> 05:38.170
The pearl.

05:38.390 --> 05:39.780
I have

05:40.120 --> 05:41.730
foreseen this.

05:42.270 --> 05:44.810
To gain, there must be loss.

05:45.510 --> 05:46.980
Since loss is inevitable,

05:47.510 --> 05:49.540
why not turn this loss to advantage?

05:50.120 --> 05:52.490
Westdawn Sect wants
the Pregenesis Sword.

05:52.510 --> 05:53.930
That's why they attacked
Ascendance Sect.

05:54.510 --> 05:55.730
But little do they know

05:56.160 --> 05:58.700
that I only have one fragment.

05:59.270 --> 06:02.490
So, they must seek
the other two fragments.

06:03.190 --> 06:04.370
Thus...

06:04.390 --> 06:06.020
We can surely lure them out.

06:09.920 --> 06:10.700
Wait.

06:10.720 --> 06:11.930
Since you want to discard it,

06:11.950 --> 06:13.930
why make me guard it?

06:14.390 --> 06:15.730
How did you even become an immortal?

06:15.750 --> 06:16.900
If we leave it for someone to take,

06:16.920 --> 06:18.370
isn't that obviously a trap?

06:18.390 --> 06:20.930
Your guarding it makes
the ruse more real.

06:21.950 --> 06:22.730
I'm speechless.

06:23.120 --> 06:24.220
It really is.

06:24.560 --> 06:26.290
The traitor Kuai Si said

06:26.310 --> 06:28.540
that Westdawn Sect is set up
in the East Sea.

06:28.560 --> 06:30.780
They'll soon trigger
the Great Tribulation.

06:30.800 --> 06:32.250
We must lure them out asap.

06:32.270 --> 06:33.340
Then what are we waiting for?

06:33.480 --> 06:35.490
Let's charge into the East Sea now.

06:35.560 --> 06:36.580
No, no.

06:36.750 --> 06:38.490
The East Sea is
the Dragon Clan's territory.

06:38.510 --> 06:39.900
If you just storm in there,

06:39.920 --> 06:41.700
it'll surely spark a human-dragon war.

06:41.920 --> 06:43.460
That would make things far worse.

06:43.480 --> 06:44.490
Then what do you suggest?

06:45.680 --> 06:48.140
Ascendance Sect has long had ties
with the Dragon Palace.

06:48.920 --> 06:51.930
We need only send a small team inside

06:52.120 --> 06:53.370
to root out the hidden mastermind.

06:53.390 --> 06:54.810
Then, we can avert
the Great Tribulation.

06:56.600 --> 06:58.100
You're humans.

06:58.480 --> 07:00.050
Will they let you enter

07:00.190 --> 07:01.540
without reason?

07:01.560 --> 07:02.290
Don't worry.

07:02.920 --> 07:04.980
I still hold a hidden trump card.

07:06.430 --> 07:08.220
Greetings, Grandlord.

07:09.920 --> 07:10.930
The Sea Deity Sect

07:11.360 --> 07:14.460
is vast in territory,
with countless disciples,

07:14.680 --> 07:17.730
but I roam afar, hard to govern.

07:17.870 --> 07:21.050
To ensure the Sea Deity Sect
endures forever,

07:21.270 --> 07:22.340
today,

07:22.870 --> 07:24.370
I formally declare

07:24.510 --> 07:25.250
the appointment

07:25.870 --> 07:28.780
of Ao Yi, Second Prince of the East Sea,

07:28.870 --> 07:30.580
as the Second Grandlord

07:30.600 --> 07:32.370
and Azure Protector

07:32.390 --> 07:34.020
to act as Grandlord.

07:34.750 --> 07:37.540
I...

07:37.600 --> 07:38.370
How could I deserve this?

07:39.190 --> 07:40.370
No need to refuse.

07:48.800 --> 07:50.850
I saw you turn into a golden dragon,

07:50.950 --> 07:53.140
fight off the demons,

07:53.160 --> 07:56.250
and save everyone.

07:56.750 --> 07:58.780
You are already a great hero.

07:59.510 --> 08:03.780
I...

08:03.800 --> 08:04.580
Am I already a great hero?

08:05.950 --> 08:07.700
I know

08:09.680 --> 08:10.730
you've always dreamed of leading

08:11.000 --> 08:12.850
the Dragon Clan back to glory.

08:13.680 --> 08:17.460
That's right.

08:17.480 --> 08:18.220
Then, now

08:18.360 --> 08:19.730
is the time.

08:20.270 --> 08:21.900
You can return to the Dragon Palace

08:22.360 --> 08:24.020
as the Second Grandlord

08:24.040 --> 08:26.370
and the Azure Protector.

08:26.390 --> 08:29.020
Then, your father and brother

08:29.390 --> 08:31.540
will see how strong you've grown

08:31.920 --> 08:35.180
after what you've been through.

08:37.000 --> 08:37.940
Yes, Grandlord.

08:38.320 --> 08:39.420
This time,

08:39.870 --> 08:42.370
I will crush Westdawn Sect's plot

08:42.870 --> 08:44.130
to pieces.

08:44.480 --> 08:46.250
As expected of Changgeng.

08:47.360 --> 08:49.300
You're nothing like what I heard.

08:49.320 --> 08:50.460
You heard about me?

08:52.750 --> 08:54.730
What did you hear about me?

08:54.870 --> 08:56.010
I heard it from my sister.

08:56.720 --> 08:59.060
She said you dodge trouble when you can

08:59.080 --> 09:01.100
and are selfish, given to despair,

09:01.120 --> 09:02.180
wallow in self-pity,

09:02.200 --> 09:02.890
and...

09:03.750 --> 09:05.060
You know what I mean.

09:07.080 --> 09:08.370
But seeing you today,

09:08.390 --> 09:10.180
you truly have a heroic air.

09:10.360 --> 09:12.890
My sister's view is too shallow.

09:14.510 --> 09:15.490
You're right.

09:17.910 --> 09:19.130
The old Changgeng

09:19.870 --> 09:21.490
would never have formulated

09:22.320 --> 09:24.100
a plan to strike first.

09:24.480 --> 09:25.530
I used to think

09:25.550 --> 09:27.460
that everything was under my control

09:27.750 --> 09:29.250
and that everything in this world

09:30.000 --> 09:32.420
would unfold as I envisioned.

09:34.600 --> 09:35.730
But I was wrong.

09:37.390 --> 09:38.530
My avoidance

09:39.720 --> 09:42.340
only let those demons run wilder,

09:42.870 --> 09:45.340
causing irreparable harm.

09:46.360 --> 09:47.530
From this day forward,

09:48.910 --> 09:50.890
I will no longer hide.

09:51.200 --> 09:53.460
Even if the Great Tribulation arrives,

09:53.960 --> 09:55.700
I will also give it a try.

09:56.270 --> 09:58.490
I will show Fate

09:59.600 --> 10:00.490
that the Great Tribulation

10:00.840 --> 10:02.770
does not come and go as it pleases.

11:01.720 --> 11:02.420
Mentor,

11:03.080 --> 11:04.370
sorry

11:06.750 --> 11:07.650
about the Transformation Art.

11:10.720 --> 11:11.730
You've worked so hard.

11:13.720 --> 11:14.890
Rest for a while.

11:17.750 --> 11:19.420
My heart is now empty.

11:21.480 --> 11:23.770
Nothing left at all.

11:26.120 --> 11:27.820
Sit with me for a while.

11:32.870 --> 11:33.650
Not yet.

11:34.790 --> 11:38.300
The sect must escort
the Second Prince back.

11:39.510 --> 11:40.850
The Second Prince named me

11:41.480 --> 11:42.770
to accompany him.

11:49.550 --> 11:51.580
I never knew you were this busy.

11:52.510 --> 11:53.300
No, wait.

11:54.320 --> 11:55.730
You were busy before too,

11:57.080 --> 11:59.100
but I never knew
what kept you so occupied.

12:02.910 --> 12:03.700
Go on.

12:06.000 --> 12:08.100
After all, I used to be alone

12:09.750 --> 12:12.130
in Jade Division.

12:14.670 --> 12:16.980
I can endure this loneliness.

12:19.390 --> 12:20.180
Go on.

12:43.480 --> 12:45.340
This jade talisman had
Kuai Si's demonic arts.

12:45.910 --> 12:46.850
Kuai Si is dead.

12:47.510 --> 12:48.820
So, the demonic arts are dispelled.

12:54.600 --> 13:00.140
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

13:00.980 --> 13:07.740
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

13:09.250 --> 13:15.180
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

13:15.760 --> 13:22.510
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

13:23.080 --> 13:30.190
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

13:30.360 --> 13:31.340
Junior Qi Yuan,

13:32.480 --> 13:33.820
since I left without saying goodbye,

13:34.030 --> 13:35.340
it's been many years.

13:36.200 --> 13:37.980
Is all well in Jade Division?

13:38.670 --> 13:40.730
Mentor and I are in Kuru Land,

13:41.120 --> 13:42.980
seeking herbs
to restore your foundation.

13:44.390 --> 13:45.980
Mortals always envy us cultivators

13:46.000 --> 13:47.650
for having a path to eternal life.

13:48.150 --> 13:49.650
A thousand years pass in a blink for us.

13:50.670 --> 13:51.890
But they do not know this:

13:53.000 --> 13:55.130
Even parted mortals
feel each day is a year.

13:55.510 --> 13:57.220
How can separated cultivators

13:58.600 --> 14:01.130
bear a thousand years of longing?

14:01.870 --> 14:03.610
So what if we have magic power?

14:04.240 --> 14:06.580
So what if we can live long?

14:07.510 --> 14:08.490
Sometimes, I think

14:09.390 --> 14:10.850
it's fine to trade
for a few decades together

14:10.870 --> 14:11.370
Set out.

14:11.390 --> 14:13.530
with these cultivation bodies

14:14.030 --> 14:15.010
of ours.

14:15.010 --> 14:16.790
[Hall of Mystic Truth]

14:16.790 --> 14:17.940
Whenever I think of this,

14:18.600 --> 14:20.010
I lie awake at night.

14:21.390 --> 14:22.250
But then I think

14:23.030 --> 14:24.650
once I've restored your foundation,

14:25.510 --> 14:27.890
we can be together for eons.

14:28.720 --> 14:29.820
Wouldn't that be even more beautiful?

14:31.790 --> 14:33.420
Kuru Land is perilous,

14:34.630 --> 14:36.490
yet some corners are truly breathtaking.

14:38.510 --> 14:39.530
At times, I think

14:39.550 --> 14:40.770
that if we both ascended,

14:41.360 --> 14:42.650
I'd surely bring you here,

14:42.670 --> 14:43.890
and we'd be
wandering immortals together.

14:46.080 --> 14:47.340
Could such a day come?

14:49.200 --> 14:49.980
Junior,

14:50.790 --> 14:52.010
I will surely return.

14:53.080 --> 14:55.420
However long it'll take,

14:55.910 --> 14:57.420
I'll return someday.

14:58.360 --> 14:59.060
So,

14:59.360 --> 15:00.490
you must stay alive

15:00.790 --> 15:01.650
and wait for me.

15:03.270 --> 15:04.370
If you dare lose heart

15:04.390 --> 15:05.770
and abandon this cultivation path,

15:06.750 --> 15:08.180
I will not forgive you.

15:12.840 --> 15:13.610
Senior,

15:15.550 --> 15:17.180
I'll remember you.

15:17.840 --> 15:20.340
You'll always be in my heart.

15:21.170 --> 15:28.490
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

15:28.760 --> 15:35.610
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

15:39.340 --> 15:42.980
[Hall of Mystic Truth]

15:43.570 --> 15:45.970
♪Past fragments♪

15:46.220 --> 15:50.870
♪Vanish into night♪

15:50.870 --> 15:53.060
[Jade Division]

16:24.240 --> 16:25.420
My Blood Gnats

16:27.750 --> 16:29.530
have been completely wiped out?

16:30.720 --> 16:32.650
Defeated Wen Jing,

16:32.790 --> 16:34.530
do you admit your guilt?

16:34.720 --> 16:35.700
I'm Wen Jing.

16:36.360 --> 16:37.610
Greetings, Two Saints of Westdawn.

16:37.670 --> 16:39.340
[Jieyin, Saint of Westdawn Sect]
You've failed to seize...

16:39.360 --> 16:40.730
[Zhunti, Saint of Westdawn Sect]
The Pregenesis Sword.

16:40.910 --> 16:41.850
Sorry for being incompetent.

16:42.320 --> 16:43.530
Incompetent?

16:45.150 --> 16:48.130
The army was dispatched,
yet all efforts were in vain.

16:48.320 --> 16:50.340
You have sabotaged
our sect's grand plan.

16:50.390 --> 16:51.980
What punishment do you deserve?

16:52.320 --> 16:53.650
I failed in proper planning.

16:54.150 --> 16:55.180
I'm unforgivable!

16:55.320 --> 16:57.010
Yet Ascendance Sect was gravely wounded.

16:57.510 --> 16:59.370
Seizing and Human Sects
became sworn foes.

16:59.480 --> 17:00.060
I think...

17:00.080 --> 17:00.980
Foolish!

17:01.320 --> 17:02.100
Arrogant!

17:11.070 --> 17:12.810
You think your petty puppetry spell

17:13.480 --> 17:15.290
can fool Voidcity?

17:15.640 --> 17:18.220
We covered for you,

17:18.720 --> 17:20.620
yet you exposed yourself.

17:22.440 --> 17:25.330
Voidcity has likely noticed you.

17:25.960 --> 17:28.380
Our sect now faces exposure.

17:28.750 --> 17:30.860
Should the Three Sects investigate,

17:31.310 --> 17:33.140
our sect may not withstand it.

17:33.790 --> 17:35.050
Now, we can only

17:35.480 --> 17:39.220
kill the demons to prove our innocence.

17:39.240 --> 17:39.900
No, no!

17:40.310 --> 17:41.010
Please, no!

17:41.200 --> 17:42.180
No!

17:43.350 --> 17:45.090
I'm begging you.

17:45.920 --> 17:47.180
I committed the guilt

17:47.550 --> 17:49.220
and wrongs alone.

17:49.680 --> 17:50.810
Should punishment come,

17:51.640 --> 17:53.490
I will bear it all.

17:53.920 --> 17:55.940
I beg you to grant this.

17:56.310 --> 17:57.250
Too late.

17:59.350 --> 18:01.490
I've already destroyed three-tenths

18:01.920 --> 18:04.660
of your clan left in the Blood Sea.

18:04.830 --> 18:06.140
I also destroyed

18:06.160 --> 18:07.570
another three-tenths.

18:07.920 --> 18:10.700
The Two Saints
of Westdawn punish the wicked

18:11.030 --> 18:14.180
to avenge the Ascendance Sect.

18:14.920 --> 18:15.730
Thus,

18:16.240 --> 18:19.860
the Three Sects won't doubt us.

18:20.550 --> 18:22.660
The fate of the remaining

18:22.830 --> 18:24.660
four-tenths of your clan

18:25.680 --> 18:28.940
depends on your future conduct.

18:29.790 --> 18:31.140
You must understand

18:31.640 --> 18:33.730
that all this karma

18:34.350 --> 18:38.090
stems from your crushing defeat today.

18:44.160 --> 18:44.700
Thanks

18:47.270 --> 18:48.770
for your grace.

18:50.790 --> 18:52.980
I will not disappoint you again.

18:53.720 --> 18:55.290
Go to the East Sea at once.

18:55.480 --> 18:57.140
Meet Jin Chan there.

18:57.960 --> 19:00.380
Jin Chan has the Pregenesis Sword.

19:00.790 --> 19:02.250
The Eye of the East Sea

19:02.790 --> 19:05.010
will open soon.

19:08.220 --> 19:12.900
[When the demons attacked
Ascendance Sect.]

20:00.920 --> 20:01.620
Lie down.

20:04.920 --> 20:06.250
A python swallowed you.

20:06.590 --> 20:08.090
You were nearly destroyed.

20:09.030 --> 20:09.660
Luckily,

20:10.790 --> 20:11.900
you met me.

20:27.160 --> 20:28.290
You cannot speak

20:28.400 --> 20:29.330
and have no memory.

20:30.070 --> 20:32.420
When I found you, you were barely alive.

20:32.680 --> 20:33.460
From now on,

20:34.160 --> 20:35.660
we'll call you Cansheng.

20:44.110 --> 20:45.010
Who are you?

20:56.920 --> 20:58.290
The sea of suffering is endless.

20:59.000 --> 21:00.250
Turn back, and you'll find the shore.

21:04.440 --> 21:05.570
You lost the Pregenesis Sword?

21:05.960 --> 21:07.290
The situation was critical.

21:07.480 --> 21:09.220
Only the Sword fragment could bait them.

21:09.270 --> 21:10.220
It was our only way to survive.

21:10.240 --> 21:11.570
You gave me your word

21:11.640 --> 21:13.380
that your fragment would be safe.

21:13.550 --> 21:15.290
They came for the Sword.

21:15.480 --> 21:17.570
If all three fragments were
in the Celestial Court,

21:17.790 --> 21:19.290
the Westdawn Sect would attack directly.

21:19.310 --> 21:21.090
The aftermath would be unimaginable.

21:26.720 --> 21:27.490
That's not wrong.

21:27.960 --> 21:29.570
We barely have forces.

21:30.310 --> 21:31.220
We couldn't hold it.

21:35.270 --> 21:36.290
Thanks for the warning.

21:36.920 --> 21:37.730
I'll hide

21:38.480 --> 21:39.900
my fragment carefully.

21:43.550 --> 21:44.660
Actually,

21:45.270 --> 21:48.660
I've come for your fragment.

21:51.310 --> 21:52.660
Ascendance Sect had this battle

21:52.680 --> 21:53.620
because we were

21:53.640 --> 21:55.490
too conservative in strategy.

21:55.550 --> 21:56.620
Even the strongest defense

21:56.640 --> 21:58.940
can't hold against repeated attacks.

22:01.400 --> 22:02.180
That's true.

22:02.200 --> 22:04.940
Since the enemy openly aims
for the Sword,

22:05.070 --> 22:07.290
we should turn defense into offense

22:07.480 --> 22:08.490
and end this threat for good.

22:11.200 --> 22:14.490
So, you deliberately let the Demon Clan

22:15.030 --> 22:16.660
take the Sword fragment.

22:16.680 --> 22:18.420
Though Westdawn Sect hasn't surfaced,

22:18.510 --> 22:20.090
they must have already slipped
into the Dragon Palace.

22:20.400 --> 22:22.180
This is our only chance
to flush them out.

22:22.480 --> 22:24.620
Once Westdawn Sect sees that fragment,

22:24.640 --> 22:25.180
they will...

22:25.200 --> 22:26.730
They'll seek out the other fragments.

22:27.070 --> 22:28.010
Your Majesty, you're wise.

22:28.030 --> 22:29.700
I happen to have a fragment.

22:29.720 --> 22:30.570
How wise of you.

22:30.590 --> 22:32.090
I can lure them out,

22:32.240 --> 22:33.570
reveal their true, ugly faces,

22:33.590 --> 22:34.860
and catch them all in one sweep.

22:35.030 --> 22:35.980
Exactly.

22:38.000 --> 22:39.900
You want me to give you the fragment?

22:42.200 --> 22:44.380
The Sword has three fragments.

22:44.590 --> 22:46.900
Even if the Westdawn Sect
seizes two fragments,

22:46.920 --> 22:47.860
they still can't

22:47.880 --> 22:49.730
unlock its original power

22:49.750 --> 22:51.330
to open the Eye of the East Sea.

22:51.350 --> 22:52.090
Therefore,

22:52.510 --> 22:54.140
as long as Fairy Yunxiao's fragment
is safe,

22:54.440 --> 22:56.570
risking my fragment is acceptable.

22:56.590 --> 22:57.810
You are right.

23:00.920 --> 23:02.050
Still, it's a little risky.

23:02.240 --> 23:03.460
I will devise a solid plan.

23:03.480 --> 23:05.250
And I will ensure everything

23:05.270 --> 23:06.490
goes exactly according to plan.

23:07.240 --> 23:09.180
This plan hardly seems your doing.

23:09.310 --> 23:10.700
Aren't you known for playing it safe?

23:12.510 --> 23:13.530
I just think

23:14.240 --> 23:15.180
that one

23:15.510 --> 23:17.730
should sometimes try

23:18.240 --> 23:19.530
something a bit risky.

23:20.420 --> 23:23.260
[Li Changshou]

23:24.960 --> 23:26.700
Connect! Connect!

23:26.720 --> 23:27.700
This is so serious.

23:27.720 --> 23:28.460
Connect!

23:28.680 --> 23:30.180
Should we bring Fairy Yunxiao in

23:30.200 --> 23:30.940
to help us out?

23:30.960 --> 23:31.660
No.

23:32.000 --> 23:32.660
We're already risking

23:32.680 --> 23:34.490
two fragments.

23:34.510 --> 23:36.050
We must not involve her further.

23:36.880 --> 23:39.770
We even need to control her whereabouts

23:40.030 --> 23:41.330
to keep her from showing up.

23:41.400 --> 23:42.730
Connect!

23:43.160 --> 23:43.980
[Fairy Yunxiao]
Connect!

23:44.000 --> 23:45.490
That's Fairy Yunxiao.

23:45.550 --> 23:46.860
She appears and vanishes
without a trace.

23:47.590 --> 23:48.730
Even Heavenreach Master

23:48.750 --> 23:50.860
can't find her.

23:52.720 --> 23:54.700
You used to find her
all the time, right?

23:56.720 --> 23:57.860
Now that you mention it,

24:00.880 --> 24:02.250
every time she came to me before,

24:02.270 --> 24:04.090
it was her Resonance that summoned me.

24:04.510 --> 24:06.330
I've never actively gone
looking for her.

24:11.480 --> 24:13.620
Maybe she's left some Resonance

24:13.640 --> 24:14.900
for you in some remote corner?

24:18.200 --> 24:19.490
I don't think so.

24:20.480 --> 24:21.250
But

24:22.480 --> 24:23.250
that's just as well.

24:24.110 --> 24:26.250
If we can't find her, we'll avoid her.

24:26.590 --> 24:27.860
It'll have the same effect.

24:28.790 --> 24:30.530
So, you're planning

24:31.200 --> 24:32.220
to never see her again?

24:37.640 --> 24:39.420
Between you and Fairy Yunxiao,

24:40.070 --> 24:41.090
what happened?

24:42.920 --> 24:43.900
Nothing.

24:46.960 --> 24:48.770
During the crisis at Ascendance Sect,

24:49.200 --> 24:51.380
Fairy Yunxiao stormed
my Hall of Soaring Heaven.

24:55.440 --> 24:57.660
She summoned the Grand Mage of Voidcity.

24:59.590 --> 25:00.380
She said

25:01.640 --> 25:03.140
she won't contact you anymore.

25:16.070 --> 25:16.860
So be it.

25:17.640 --> 25:18.490
With her out of the way,

25:18.880 --> 25:20.050
we can now carry out

25:20.070 --> 25:21.330
our East Sea plan.

25:24.550 --> 25:25.570
You two argued.

25:26.510 --> 25:28.700
Fairy Yunxiao is
such an important person.

25:28.720 --> 25:29.330
I...

25:29.640 --> 25:30.770
How could a lowly disciple like me

25:30.790 --> 25:32.380
ever rein her in?

25:32.400 --> 25:34.570
I simply want her to be free,

25:34.590 --> 25:36.010
far from all turmoil.

25:36.200 --> 25:37.570
That would satisfy me.

25:39.920 --> 25:41.660
Your Majesty, may I speak?

25:41.680 --> 25:43.250
I have another request.

25:45.310 --> 25:46.380
This East Sea plan

25:46.400 --> 25:48.290
will inevitably clash
with Westdawn Sect.

25:48.310 --> 25:49.620
I need many more weapons
and instruments.

25:49.640 --> 25:50.180
None.

25:51.070 --> 25:51.860
I haven't even finished.

25:51.880 --> 25:53.330
How would you know there aren't any?

25:53.350 --> 25:54.460
Really, there's none.

25:55.200 --> 25:56.570
The Celestial Court is vast.

25:56.720 --> 25:57.860
There must be some instruments.

25:57.880 --> 25:58.980
You're being so stingy!

25:59.000 --> 25:59.490
Hand them over!

25:59.510 --> 26:00.730
There were some before.

26:01.000 --> 26:01.700
Now, they're gone.

26:03.110 --> 26:04.620
What do you mean?

26:04.640 --> 26:05.330
That's impossible.

26:05.350 --> 26:06.460
You must have some.

26:06.510 --> 26:07.860
Why would I lie?

26:07.920 --> 26:09.810
Didn't Fairy Yunxiao come by once?

26:10.110 --> 26:11.290
So what if she came by?

26:11.310 --> 26:12.700
The Court's weapons
and magic instruments

26:12.830 --> 26:13.900
were all taken.

26:13.920 --> 26:15.090
All taken?

26:15.240 --> 26:15.660
Yeah.

26:17.790 --> 26:18.620
Take what?

26:19.030 --> 26:20.090
Who's trying to take things again?

26:22.110 --> 26:25.050
Only one way in or out
of the Dragon Palace.

26:25.310 --> 26:26.900
If a fire broke out,

26:26.920 --> 26:28.010
we'd be trapped.

26:28.070 --> 26:29.220
You fool.

26:29.510 --> 26:31.180
The Dragon Palace is all water.

26:31.200 --> 26:32.810
How could there be a fire?

26:33.000 --> 26:33.810
That's true.

26:34.640 --> 26:36.460
[Token]
It's all part of His Majesty's plan.

26:36.720 --> 26:37.860
Without the Dragon Gate Token,

26:38.310 --> 26:40.090
no one can invade our East Sea.

26:40.310 --> 26:42.220
Who'd dare attack the East Sea?

26:42.550 --> 26:43.290
Tell me.

26:43.790 --> 26:44.980
We'll go report

26:45.000 --> 26:46.530
the Little Prince's return.

26:46.550 --> 26:47.490
If His Majesty is pleased,

26:47.510 --> 26:49.090
might he grant us a reward?

26:49.110 --> 26:49.700
Maybe.

26:52.100 --> 26:53.340
[Token]

26:55.440 --> 26:56.090
Alright.

26:57.200 --> 26:57.980
Drink.

26:59.310 --> 27:01.180
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

27:01.200 --> 27:01.900
You two.

27:02.350 --> 27:02.940
Turtle.

27:02.960 --> 27:03.490
Your Majesty.

27:03.510 --> 27:04.570
Perfect timing. Come, come.

27:04.590 --> 27:05.770
Drink with me.

27:05.790 --> 27:06.700
I'll pass for now.

27:06.720 --> 27:07.730
Urgent report, Your Majesty!

27:07.750 --> 27:09.290
The Second Prince is back.

27:09.400 --> 27:10.530
Second Prince?

27:11.070 --> 27:12.220
What's this "second"?

27:13.270 --> 27:14.250
How many sons do I have?

27:14.270 --> 27:16.460
Your Majesty, your second son, Ao Yi.

27:16.480 --> 27:17.490
He's back.

27:23.920 --> 27:24.700
Exactly.

27:26.510 --> 27:27.090
Ao Yi?

27:27.240 --> 27:28.050
Yes, yes!

27:29.350 --> 27:31.810
No, he barely left.

27:32.110 --> 27:34.220
So, he couldn't handle it outside

27:34.920 --> 27:35.730
and came back?

27:35.750 --> 27:36.730
Yes.

27:37.110 --> 27:38.700
It looks like Yi

27:39.750 --> 27:41.490
still hasn't grown up.

27:42.110 --> 27:43.250
Your Majesty!

27:46.400 --> 27:47.940
Do you all know what day it is?

27:49.310 --> 27:51.180
The Second Prince is coming back.

27:51.590 --> 27:52.730
It's a joyful day, a good thing.

27:52.750 --> 27:53.620
So cheer up, everyone.

27:53.640 --> 27:54.730
Smile, smile!

27:54.750 --> 27:55.620
When you play later,

27:55.640 --> 27:56.700
give it your all.

27:56.750 --> 27:58.900
Make my little brother happy.

28:02.110 --> 28:02.660
Father.

28:03.440 --> 28:04.940
The band is all ready.

28:06.070 --> 28:09.090
The Little Prince is young, after all.

28:09.240 --> 28:11.770
It's his first time out.
Setbacks are inevitable.

28:12.270 --> 28:14.900
A little dragon, first time out.

28:14.920 --> 28:16.290
What majesty could he have?

28:16.310 --> 28:17.700
Back when I was out there,

28:17.720 --> 28:19.860
I endured so many hardships.

28:19.880 --> 28:20.570
Father.

28:20.920 --> 28:22.700
Things are not like your time anymore.

28:22.880 --> 28:25.250
No matter how much he suffered outside,

28:25.510 --> 28:26.900
as long as he comes back home,

28:26.920 --> 28:28.290
we'll shower him with love.

28:28.440 --> 28:30.220
He's our little treasure, after all.

28:30.240 --> 28:31.290
Little treasure.

28:33.030 --> 28:34.620
The little treasure's here.

28:37.350 --> 28:38.900
He's here! Play the music!

28:52.160 --> 28:53.010
He's back!

28:54.030 --> 28:54.530
Stop the music!

28:54.550 --> 28:55.660
Stop, stop!

28:56.510 --> 28:57.700
Yi.

28:58.270 --> 28:59.180
- No.
- Your Majesty!

28:59.200 --> 28:59.790
- You're back.
- Your Majesty!

28:59.790 --> 29:00.530
I've missed you so much.

29:00.550 --> 29:01.330
Your Majesty, this isn't...

29:01.350 --> 29:02.330
Wrong, wrong.

29:02.350 --> 29:03.730
Wrong, wrong.

29:03.750 --> 29:04.140
Wrong.

29:04.160 --> 29:04.700
Yi.

29:05.030 --> 29:05.810
Your Majesty, Your Majesty.

29:05.960 --> 29:06.770
Yi is not so chubby.

29:07.000 --> 29:07.700
My Yi.

29:07.750 --> 29:09.180
How did you get so round, Yi?

29:09.350 --> 29:10.700
What on earth have you been eating

29:10.830 --> 29:11.620
to end up like this?

29:12.310 --> 29:13.420
Greetings, Dragon King.

29:14.160 --> 29:16.290
Who are you?

29:16.960 --> 29:17.770
Hello, everyone.

29:18.110 --> 29:20.570
We are of the Sea Deity Sect.

29:20.920 --> 29:22.770
By order of our Grandlord,

29:22.790 --> 29:24.980
we are escorting Ao Yi, Second Grandlord

29:25.000 --> 29:27.180
and Azure Protector,

29:27.240 --> 29:28.180
back to the East Sea.

29:28.200 --> 29:28.940
The Sea Deity Sect?

29:29.030 --> 29:29.810
Second Grandlord?

29:29.920 --> 29:30.730
Azure Protector?

29:31.000 --> 29:32.530
Isn't this the East Sea?

29:32.680 --> 29:34.770
What is the Sea Deity Grandlord?

29:35.070 --> 29:36.700
How come I've never heard of him?

29:36.750 --> 29:38.900
Our Grandlord is called

29:39.310 --> 29:41.090
Changgeng the Great.

29:41.790 --> 29:42.900
Changgeng?

29:43.030 --> 29:44.050
Changgeng again.

29:44.400 --> 29:45.700
Here it comes again!

29:47.070 --> 29:47.810
Here it comes!

29:47.830 --> 29:48.940
Music! Music!

29:57.030 --> 29:57.810
Stop.

29:59.310 --> 30:00.330
Yi, my boy.

30:00.830 --> 30:02.090
- Yi, you're finally back!
- That's my...

30:02.110 --> 30:02.980
Your Majesty.

30:03.000 --> 30:03.620
I've missed you dearly.

30:03.640 --> 30:04.290
Your Majesty, your Majesty.

30:04.310 --> 30:05.860
Wrong again, wrong again!

30:05.880 --> 30:06.290
- What's wrong?
- Your Majesty.

30:06.290 --> 30:07.180
It's wrong again.

30:07.200 --> 30:08.050
How did he become a woman?

30:08.440 --> 30:10.050
It's been so long, and Yi is a woman.

30:10.070 --> 30:11.010
Greetings, Dragon King.

30:11.960 --> 30:12.220
You...

30:15.240 --> 30:16.900
Didn't you break off our betrothal?

30:17.720 --> 30:19.250
So, you are no longer one of us.

30:19.480 --> 30:20.490
Then why are you here today?

30:20.920 --> 30:22.530
Today, I'm not

30:22.550 --> 30:23.700
your follower.

30:24.000 --> 30:26.490
I am Ao Yi's personal guard.

30:26.510 --> 30:27.220
Personal?

30:27.240 --> 30:27.860
Guard?

30:27.880 --> 30:28.810
Personal guard?

30:28.830 --> 30:31.620
By order of Grandlord Changgeng,

30:31.750 --> 30:33.090
we brought the Little Prince home.

30:33.510 --> 30:34.660
Changgeng again.

30:35.200 --> 30:36.860
Second Prince Ao Yi's strength

30:37.000 --> 30:39.140
has earned our warriors' respect.

30:39.160 --> 30:40.220
From this day on,

30:40.550 --> 30:42.100
the Mermaid Clan will follow him

30:42.280 --> 30:43.250
and join the East Sea.

30:43.920 --> 30:44.620
Good.

30:44.640 --> 30:45.730
The more, the merrier.

30:46.160 --> 30:47.700
What's so great? She...

30:47.720 --> 30:48.810
Here it comes again.

30:48.830 --> 30:49.700
Here it comes again.

30:52.350 --> 30:53.620
Don't worry.

30:54.110 --> 30:57.140
Watch my cue, play slowly.

31:05.110 --> 31:05.900
Stop.

31:13.110 --> 31:14.250
Still not right.

31:14.920 --> 31:16.700
Yi... Yi...

31:18.440 --> 31:19.090
Wrong again.

31:19.110 --> 31:20.090
Wrong again?

31:20.350 --> 31:21.250
Come on.

31:21.590 --> 31:23.530
Must you be everywhere?

31:25.350 --> 31:28.330
By the order of Grandlord Changgeng,

31:28.750 --> 31:30.010
the Ascendance envoy is here

31:30.030 --> 31:31.860
- to escort Ao Yi
- Envoy?

31:31.880 --> 31:33.090
back to the Dragon Palace.

31:33.310 --> 31:35.180
This place

31:35.310 --> 31:36.490
is Ao Yi's home.

31:36.880 --> 31:38.050
Does he need you to escort him?

31:40.000 --> 31:42.620
Days ago,
demons besieged Ascendance Sect.

31:42.720 --> 31:45.180
The Little Prince defeated demons
as a golden dragon.

31:45.310 --> 31:46.900
He did great deeds for us.

31:47.110 --> 31:47.620
To show sincerity...

31:47.640 --> 31:48.250
A golden dragon?

31:48.270 --> 31:50.010
We brought gifts

31:50.310 --> 31:52.220
to resolve human-dragon enmity.

31:52.590 --> 31:53.620
Ao Yi turned

31:55.350 --> 31:56.490
into a golden dragon?

32:08.000 --> 32:09.090
Wake up, he's here.

32:09.590 --> 32:10.380
Who's here?

32:10.510 --> 32:11.380
He's here!

32:20.720 --> 32:21.860
He's really here!

32:21.880 --> 32:23.330
Play faster, play faster!

32:23.550 --> 32:24.420
Get excited!

32:25.110 --> 32:26.490
Your Majesty, Your Majesty!

32:26.510 --> 32:27.900
He's really here this time.

32:27.920 --> 32:28.380
Who's here?

32:28.400 --> 32:29.250
The Second Prince.

32:32.110 --> 32:32.980
Yi.

32:36.440 --> 32:37.290
Yi

32:37.500 --> 32:39.090
- You're finally back!
- Father.

32:39.110 --> 32:41.900
Do you know how much I've missed you?

32:42.480 --> 32:43.050
Father.

32:45.590 --> 32:46.620
I ran away from home,

32:46.640 --> 32:47.660
causing you such worry.

32:48.160 --> 32:49.090
Please, punish me, Father.

32:49.240 --> 32:50.420
What matters is you're home safe.

32:50.440 --> 32:51.420
That's what matters.

32:51.720 --> 32:53.460
No matter what hardships

32:53.480 --> 32:54.490
you endured out there,

32:54.640 --> 32:56.090
now that you're back,

32:56.110 --> 32:57.700
no one will dare bully you again.

32:58.310 --> 32:58.940
Father,

32:59.400 --> 33:00.700
I've found a way

33:00.920 --> 33:02.490
to restore our clan's former glory.

33:05.720 --> 33:07.530
You've found a way?

33:08.440 --> 33:08.980
Come.

33:10.790 --> 33:11.570
Look.

33:25.640 --> 33:26.490
This time,

33:26.750 --> 33:29.010
we'll have to foil Westdawn Sect's plot

33:30.030 --> 33:31.490
and complete

33:32.070 --> 33:33.900
the Dragon Clan's ascension plan.

33:34.160 --> 33:36.420
So, the Celestial Court must step in

33:36.440 --> 33:37.730
to resolve the Dragon Clan crisis.

33:38.000 --> 33:39.660
Then, I'll pin the credit

33:39.680 --> 33:40.810
on you.

33:40.830 --> 33:41.700
And the Dragon Clan

33:42.030 --> 33:43.250
will naturally

33:43.270 --> 33:45.180
and willingly come over to your side.

33:46.830 --> 33:47.660
Great idea!

33:49.350 --> 33:52.220
Then, I'll descend to the East Sea

33:52.240 --> 33:53.490
as the Celestial Emperor.

33:53.750 --> 33:54.900
Are you crazy?

33:55.200 --> 33:56.860
If you go to the East Sea,

33:56.880 --> 33:58.290
they'll think it's a coup and rebel.

33:58.310 --> 33:59.050
What then?

34:01.720 --> 34:02.810
Well, what do you suggest?

34:04.880 --> 34:05.660
Well.

34:06.510 --> 34:07.460
I think

34:08.440 --> 34:10.130
we need someone else

34:10.710 --> 34:12.650
to stand for the Celestial Court.

34:13.070 --> 34:14.050
But this person

34:14.070 --> 34:16.980
must be honest, obedient, and discreet.

34:17.150 --> 34:18.690
They can vanish for ten or so days

34:18.710 --> 34:20.050
without anyone noticing.

34:20.070 --> 34:21.050
And the key thing is

34:21.630 --> 34:23.980
they must fit the public's image

34:24.070 --> 34:25.460
of a deity:

34:25.480 --> 34:28.940
white hair, white brows, white beard...

34:35.480 --> 34:36.530
flowing robes, and wide sleeves.

35:01.510 --> 35:05.090
I am Moon Elder,
envoy of the Celestial Emperor.

35:07.150 --> 35:10.170
By the order of Grandlord Changgeng...

35:12.000 --> 35:13.380
Changgeng again.

35:13.590 --> 35:17.900
I'm here to congratulate
the return of Prince Ao Yi.

35:18.360 --> 35:19.820
Your Majesty, Your Majesty!

35:20.960 --> 35:21.820
An immortal envoy!

35:22.400 --> 35:23.260
Oh, an immortal envoy.

35:32.440 --> 35:34.380
So, the immortal envoy is here.

35:34.440 --> 35:35.650
My apologies. Forgive me.

35:36.800 --> 35:37.420
Yi,

35:37.710 --> 35:38.380
it's such a big event.

35:38.400 --> 35:40.210
Why didn't you tell me beforehand?

35:41.800 --> 35:42.340
Turtle,

35:42.550 --> 35:43.900
prepare a feast! A grand feast!

35:43.920 --> 35:44.650
No, no!

35:44.670 --> 35:45.340
I can't drink.

35:45.360 --> 35:46.260
Come on, please.

35:46.280 --> 35:47.130
I can't drink; I already threw up!

35:47.150 --> 35:48.010
Please, please!

35:49.710 --> 35:50.490
No way!

35:51.110 --> 35:52.780
Not again?

35:52.920 --> 35:53.900
Yi,

35:53.920 --> 35:56.050
how many people did
you bring back today?

35:57.000 --> 35:57.940
I...

35:58.800 --> 36:00.780
How many should I have brought today?

36:01.190 --> 36:02.420
I have no idea!

36:08.880 --> 36:09.980
Yunxiao.

36:13.360 --> 36:14.420
Fairy Yunxiao.

36:28.110 --> 36:30.900
Fairy Yunxiao, nice to meet you.

36:30.920 --> 36:33.420
What brings you back

36:33.710 --> 36:35.090
to the East Sea?

36:35.110 --> 36:37.570
Sent by Grandlord Changgeng,

36:37.760 --> 36:40.610
I'm here to escort the Prince Ao Yi

36:40.630 --> 36:41.780
back to the Dragon Palace.

36:52.070 --> 36:55.820
You're all sent

36:56.920 --> 36:58.460
by Grandlord Changgeng

36:59.030 --> 37:00.090
to escort my son?

37:01.920 --> 37:02.650
Is that so?

37:04.110 --> 37:04.820
Is that so?

37:07.320 --> 37:09.380
I have a question, though.

37:09.510 --> 37:12.260
Please enlighten me.

37:13.280 --> 37:15.690
Who is Changgeng?

37:20.030 --> 37:21.740
This is hardly a return.

37:21.760 --> 37:23.420
Clearly, he's back to flaunt

37:23.440 --> 37:24.490
his authority

37:24.510 --> 37:25.820
before Father and me.

37:29.190 --> 37:31.650
So, he covets my position
as the Crown Prince.

37:31.960 --> 37:33.690
To think I cared so much for his safety.

37:34.320 --> 37:35.090
Ao Yi.

37:36.280 --> 37:36.820
He...

37:37.920 --> 37:39.010
He's a jerk!

37:43.230 --> 37:45.420
Grandlord Changgeng
of the Sea Deity Sect.

37:46.550 --> 37:47.610
Your Highness,

37:49.150 --> 37:50.490
do you still remember that name?

37:53.760 --> 37:54.610
Changgeng.

37:56.360 --> 37:57.900
How could I forget that name?

37:59.150 --> 38:00.490
All my failures

38:02.030 --> 38:03.340
are thanks to him.

38:04.110 --> 38:04.900
I want revenge.

38:05.590 --> 38:06.740
I'll kill him.

38:08.030 --> 38:10.300
The battle in the South Sea was costly.

38:11.550 --> 38:13.170
You haven't recovered yet.

38:14.030 --> 38:16.090
For now, just rest and recuperate.

38:16.190 --> 38:17.090
Don't bother

38:18.230 --> 38:19.610
with everything else.

38:25.670 --> 38:26.460
Right.

38:28.320 --> 38:29.260
Don't bother with it.

38:30.880 --> 38:31.820
Don't bother with it.

38:33.280 --> 38:34.300
Don't bother with it.

38:40.150 --> 38:41.260
Master Jin Chan,

38:42.110 --> 38:43.260
the Sea Deity Sect...

38:49.360 --> 38:51.130
Ao Yi's return now

38:52.480 --> 38:53.900
is no coincidence.

38:56.070 --> 38:57.690
It's Changgeng's scheme.

38:59.110 --> 39:01.210
He's come to avenge Ascendance Sect.

39:38.270 --> 39:44.050
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

39:44.720 --> 39:51.420
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

39:52.950 --> 39:59.000
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

39:59.630 --> 40:06.080
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

40:06.820 --> 40:13.940
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

40:14.320 --> 40:21.220
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

40:21.600 --> 40:28.950
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

40:28.950 --> 40:36.120
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

40:52.260 --> 40:57.430
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

40:58.520 --> 41:05.540
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

41:06.730 --> 41:12.670
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

41:13.370 --> 41:20.450
♪Alas, our story is short♪

41:20.790 --> 41:27.900
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

41:28.220 --> 41:34.700
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

41:35.480 --> 41:42.690
♪Tears fall, this fate's not done♪

41:43.080 --> 41:50.900
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
